    "observation_access": "Self fields and declared public counters/charts are exact. For each entity slot, visibility is active AND Chebyshev distance <= 3 from the role's current position; hidden slots have visible=0 and all values zero. Actor slots use the same radius. Patches cover dx,dy -3..3 in row-major order, outside=-1. Public static bounds, indexing and action meanings do not expose hidden current state. Legal masks are native affordance information; no renderer-only policy information. Human and policy actors use the same scalar action and transition."
  },
